        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Gail, Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Richard Lineback, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, Whitman Mayo\n- Products: Somebody's Daughter, D.C. Cab, Barney Miller, Fish\n- Roles: Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz, Detective Phil Fish\n- Topics: television films, comedy films, fictional NYPD detectives\n\nFacts:\n- D.C. Cab, also known as Street Fight, is a 1983 American comedy film starring Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, and Whitman Mayo.\n- Somebody's Daughter is a 1992 television film starring Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Max Gail, and Richard Lineback.\n- Max Gail is most notable for portraying Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz on the television sitcom Barney Miller.\n- Detective Phil Fish is a fictional NYPD detective in the TV series Barney Miller and later in the spin-off series Fish.",
